  "project_description": "SynMap displays a small, single-location map block using Yandex Maps, Google Maps or OpenStreetMap (Leaflet). It attaches a client-side map to a configurable CSS selector on selected pages (whole site, front page, a contact/path page, or everywhere except a path). The office/point-of-interest coordinates, zoom, marker label, center offset and provider API keys are set on one admin settings form. Part of the Synapse module family.",
